#. §4: `h`
#: Game.Levels.Strings.L03_Rewrite
msgid "When you know §0, you can replace §1 by §2 anywhere in the goal.\n"
"The tactic §3 does this: it rewrites the left side of §4 into the right side."
msgstr ""

#: Game
msgid "Learn DFAs, NFAs, closure properties and non-regularity by proving them in Lean."
msgstr ""

#. §0: `«{h₂}»`
