#. §0: `generalizing`
#: Game.Levels.DFA.L11_Language
msgid "**World complete.** You proved that a machine recognises a language: the core\n"
"skill of this game. The recipe was:\n"
"\n"
"1. describe the run from **every** state (induction, §0);\n"
"2. read off acceptance from the start state.\n"
"\n"
"Next: machines that can guess."
msgstr ""

